re::net::SocketAddr`].  Fields that the C code zeros out\n37\t//!   to mean \"address not yet set\" become `Option<SocketAddr>`.\n38\t//! * `Quic`, `Connection`, `Path` were\n39\t//!   forward-declared as opaque stubs in\n40\t//!   [`crate`] (the public header).  Their\n41\t//!   real bodies live here; the public module re-exports the\n42\t//!   names so existing `use` paths in other modules keep\n43\t//!   working.\n44\t//! * Function pointer typedefs (`autoqlog_fn`,\n45\t//!   `performance_log_fn`, the spin-bit pair, the\n46\t//!   memlog hook on a connection, `mask_fns_t`) collapse to\n47\t//!   traits per the project rule.  When two function pointers\n48\t//!   are always installed together (`SpinbitDef`,\n49\t//!   `mask_fns_t`) they share one trait.\n50\t//! * Conditional fields gated by `BBRExperiment` and\n51\t//!   `WITH_THREAD_CHECK` are dropped — they are not\n52\t//!   part of the v1 target build.\n53\t//! * The `PARSE_*`/`IS_*_STREAM_ID(_*)` macros that the C\n54\t//!   header inlines as preprocessor macros are translated to\n55\t//!   `pub const fn` helpers.\n56\t\n57\tuse std::collections::{BTreeMap, VecDeque};\n58\tuse std::fs::File;\n59\tuse std::path::PathBuf;\n60\t\n61\tuse core::any::Any;\n62\tuse core::net::SocketAddr;\n63\t\n64\tuse crate::arena::{Arena, Token};\n65\tuse crate::hash::{HashTable, HashToken};\n66\tuse crate::splay::{SplayToken, SplayTree};\n67\tuse crate::{Duration, Instant};\n68\t\n69\t/// Token into the per-`Quic` connection arena.\n70\t///\n71\t/// Phase 4 plan: every C `*mut picoquic_cnx_t` becomes a\n72\t/// [`ConnectionToken`].  Following it requires `quic.connections.get(tok)`\n73\t/// — one indirection through the arena, plus a generation check.\n74\t/// Stable across operations on other connections.\n75\tpub type ConnectionToken = Token<Connection>;\n76\t\n77\t/// Token into the per-`Quic` registered-token replay-protection arena.\n78\tpub type RegisteredTokenToken = Token<RegisteredToken>;\n79\t\n80\t/// Token into the 